WEBVTT

00:15:28.666 --> 00:15:30.688
How do I get to be like you?"

00:15:30.712 --> 00:15:34.366
And he laughed
and looked at me and told me

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:39.390
that professional services firms,
all they have is people.

00:15:39.816 --> 00:15:43.127
So they're going to do their best
to make the best of you.

00:15:43.151 --> 00:15:45.297
And that's how I found out
about consulting.

00:15:45.321 --> 00:15:48.618
AG: Research shows that role models
can elevate our aspirations.

00:15:48.642 --> 00:15:51.363
When we see someone similar to us
do something inspiring,

00:15:51.387 --> 00:15:54.784
it builds our confidence
that we can follow in their footsteps.

00:15:54.808 --> 00:15:56.730
When Gonzalo graduated from college,

00:15:56.754 --> 00:15:58.707
he followed his role model's advice

00:15:58.731 --> 00:16:01.222
and went to work
as a consultant at Accenture.